</td>
<td><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/%D0%93%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%8F%20%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0" title="Main Page/ru">Wiki - Начало</a>
